  "rationale": "Genome-wide Brunello knockout screen in Jurkat T-ALL cells stained for Galectin-9 and sorted into the top and bottom 20%, two replicate infections. Counts were merged from the six per-sample GEO files (one file per GSM; bin and replicate in the file names). Both bins of a replicate were sorted from one infected population, so replicate is a blocking term (1 residual df). Activators of LGALS9 (IRF1, TFAP4) should be depleted in the Galectin-9-high bin; LGALS9 guides themselves are the positive control. Unsorted libraries are not used."
